I've confirmed the bug. Comparing with the documented format, I found the following issues:
1. Lines are not trimmed before being checked (indented sections/keys break; `#` isn't handled as a comment)
2. Section names are not lowercased
3. `LastIndex("=")` instead of the first `=`
4. The inline comment cut at any `;`, instead of only ` ;`/` #`; and it was being done before quote processing
5. Quoted values had their internal whitespace trimmed (it should be preserved)
6. Duplicate keys retain the first value instead of being overwritten

Applying the fixes:
